## Part One

### Code

```elixir
defmodule PartOne do
  import Parser
  
  def resolve(input) do
    IO.puts("--- Part One ---")
    IO.puts("Result: #{run(input)}")
  end

  def run(input) do
    input
    |> Enum.map(fn row ->
        (increasing?(row) or decreasing?(row)) and threes?(row)
      end)
    |> Enum.count(& &1)  # count how many were true
  end
end
```

